{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"List on the market"},"description":"Put something on the Market as the person, from what they said in\none sentence (\"40 broilers ready on the 12th, Harare\"): produce for sale\n(`kind` SALE) or something they want to buy (WANTED, with a\n`quantity`). `item` and `unit` are plain words (\"tomatoes\", \"20 L\nbucket\"). Left out, a sale takes the unit most local prices use and the\nusual local `price` (in major units, such as 12.50), and the place's\ncurrency; say that price to the person. `ready_on` (YYYY-MM-DD, up to 90\ndays ahead) lists it now as a pre-order. It needs a place: a town, one\nof their farms or a lat/lng; with none, their only farm. A sale needs a\nphoto already on Divisi (`media` as `{type, id}` refs); without one the\nreply is the link to the screen where they add it, signed in on the web\nor in the app. Reuse `client_id` (a UUID) to retry. Nothing is\ncharged.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"currency":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Currency"},"description":{"default":"","title":"Description","type":"string"},"farm_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Farm Id"},"item":{"title":"Item","type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["SALE","WANTED"],"title":"Kind","type":"string"},"lat":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Lat"},"lng":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Lng"},"media":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Media"},"negotiable":{"default":true,"title":"Negotiable","type":"boolean"},"place":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Place"},"p